  <div class="warn">Excluded = name appeared in research but deliberately not in main directory, with reason recorded. Four kinds: (1) regulatory / safeguarding (e.g. license inactive, court-set-aside findings), (2) unverifiable (no primary source), (3) wrong specialism, (4) out of scope (e.g. civil-servant peritos withheld for ethical-naming reasons).</div>
